' diagram-type: sequence
@startuml
title v0006-web-ui - configured bootstrap operator + team live events without auth

participant "Web UI / Browser" as UI
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "State Registry" as State

UI -> GW : WebSocket upgrade\n(possibly forged X-FlowAI-* headers)
GW -> GW : strip client identity context\nvalidate configured bootstrap operator + team\ngenerate request_id
alt configured bootstrap operator or team context invalid
  GW --> UI : reject upgrade before subscription
else valid configured bootstrap operator and team
  GW -> State : subscribe with configured Operator-ID\n(audit attribution only), configured Team-ID,\ndisplay-only Team-Name, Request-ID\n(no browser bearer credential)
  State -> State : filter authorized events by team_id
  State --> GW : configured-team task event stream
  GW --> UI : event frames unchanged
end

@enduml
